to settle account for amount
    given account is an editable Account
    given amount is a positive Money
    if all of
        account is open
        any of
            balance of account ≥ amount
            overdraft_allowed of account
    then
        subtract amount from balance of account
    otherwise if none of account is frozen, account is closed
    then
        flag account
    otherwise
        do nothing
    repeat while all of
        balance of account < 0
        retries of account > 0
    do
        decrement retries of account
